accounting_block = Manifest(
    name="Accounting",
    icon="🧾",
    classification=Classification.worker,
    tags=["orders", "finance"],
    connections=[Manifest(name="Kafka"), Manifest(name="PostgreSQL")],
    info=Info(
        description=Markdown(
            "### Asynchronous order bookkeeping\n"
            "\n"
            "Processes incoming orders from Kafka and tallies the sum of all orders (mock). Written in .NET.\n"
            "\n"
            "#### What to inspect\n"
            "\n"
            "| Area | Investigation |\n"
            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| **Processing duration** | Find slow work after an order has already completed |\n"
            "| **Database errors** | Check whether a failed write leads to retry or data loss |\n"
            "| **Duplicate events** | Compare totals after replaying an order |\n"
            "\n"
            "#### Illustrative flow\n"
            "\n"
            "```text\n"
            "Kafka order event -> Accounting -> PostgreSQL\n"
            "```\n"
            "\n"
            "#### Suggested demo exercise\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Establish a baseline.\n"
            "   - Complete a mock purchase and locate the later accounting work. Compare request latency with the time until that order becomes visible in accounting storage.\n"
            "2. Compare the evidence.\n"
            "   - Correlate **traces**, *logs*, and metrics within the same time window.\n"
            "   - Save the relevant trace ID with the observed result.\n"
            "\n"
            "- [ ] Test replay and restart behavior with synthetic orders before assuming exactly-once processing.\n"
            "- [ ] Restore the starting configuration after the exercise.\n"
            "\n"
            "> These are proposed learning exercises, not guarantees about configured alerts,\n"
            "> recovery policies, or production readiness.\n"
            "\n"
            "\n"
            "### Frameworks and tools\n"
            "\n"
            "- **Framework layers in this sample**\n"
            "  - No web framework is modeled for this component; inspect its service runtime and integration clients instead.\n"
            "- **Example development and investigation toolkit**\n"
            "  - dotnet CLI for builds and tests\n"
            "  - NuGet for dependency management\n"
            "  - dotnet-counters for runtime metrics\n"
            "- **Example observability tools**\n"
            "  - `prometheus`\n"
            "  - `loki`\n"
            "  - `jaeger`\n"
            "  - `grafana`\n"
            "\n"
            "The tool lists illustrate a possible setup for this architecture; they do not install tools or assert that an upstream project uses every listed tool.\n"
        ),
        version=parse_version("1.0.0"),
        languages=[ProgrammingLanguage.csharp],
