            "   - Correlate **traces**, *logs*, and metrics within the same time window.\n"
            "   - Save the relevant trace ID with the observed result.\n"
            "\n"
            "- [ ] Document retry behavior for a timeout after the mock shipment was created.\n"
            "- [ ] Restore the starting configuration after the exercise.\n"
            "\n"
            "> These are proposed learning exercises, not guarantees about configured alerts,\n"
            "> recovery policies, or production readiness.\n"
            "\n"
            "\n"
            "### Frameworks and tools\n"
            "\n"
            "- **Framework layers in this sample**\n"
            "  - No web framework is modeled for this component; inspect its service runtime and integration clients instead.\n"
            "- **Example development and investigation toolkit**\n"
            "  - Cargo for builds and tests\n"
            "  - Clippy for static analysis\n"
            "  - rustfmt for formatting\n"
            "- **Example observability tools**\n"
            "  - `prometheus`\n"
            "  - `loki`\n"
            "  - `jaeger`\n"
            "  - `grafana`\n"
            "\n"
            "The tool lists illustrate a possible setup for this architecture; they do not install tools or assert that an upstream project uses every listed tool.\n"
        ),
        version=parse_version("1.0.0"),
        languages=[ProgrammingLanguage.rust],
        deployments=[DeploymentTarget.k8s_cluster, DeploymentTarget.helm],
        owners="Logistics",
        metric_tools=[
            MetricTool.prometheus,
            MetricTool.loki,
            MetricTool.jaeger,
            MetricTool.grafana,
        ],
        links=[Link(site_name="Demo Docs", http_url=_DOCS)],
    ),
)
